	(text "R_NTC at 10k Ohms matches the resistance from the NTC at 25 Celcius\n\nNTC: NASA GSFC S-311-P-18 qualified 10 kΩ thermistor (YSI/TE 44907, β = 3574 K), leaded, bonded to the cells"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 86.87 118.11 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "19daa06b-19a2-4cc2-9011-6bccb38e6789")
	)
	(text "RESISTOR VALUE RATIONALE - NTC SENSE & HEATER THERMOSTAT (identical on channels A and B)\nR_NTC 10 kΩ: equals the NTC's R25, so NTC_x = 3.3 V × R_th / (R_th + 10k) = 1.65 V at 25 °C\n	(mid-rail, steepest slope). Divider draws 165 µA; NTC self-heating ≈ 0.27 mW, negligible measurement error.\n\nH_Thermostat_TOP 150 kΩ / H_Thermostat_BOT 300 kΩ: V+ = 3.3 V × 300k / 450k = 2.20 V, trips at R_th = 20 kΩ \n	(≈ 8.7 °C, β = 3574 K). 2:1 ratio with E24 values; ≥ 150 kΩ keeps divider bias at ≈ 7 µA per channel.\n\nOp-Amp_Feedback 1.0 MΩ: positive feedback from CMP_OUT adds hysteresis so the heater does not chatter at the threshold:\n     heater OFF (output released, V+ = 2.30 V): heater turns ON below ≈ 5.7 °C (R_th > 23.0 kΩ)\n     heater ON (output pulled low, V+ = 2.00 V): heater turns OFF above ≈ 14.7 °C (R_th < 15.4 kΩ)\n\nR_PullUp 10 kΩ: MCP65R46 output is open-drain, so it pulls CMP_OUT / FPF2700 ON to 3.3 V. ON is active-LOW:\n	cold, so NTC_x > V+, so the output sinks and the heater turns on. Sink current 0.33 mA; 10k ≪ 1.0M,\n	so it barely shifts the hysteresis."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 159.26 94.74 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "3e9f24fc-2e86-46d8-824b-8e99d23e06a4")
	)
	(text "RESISTOR VALUE RATIONALE - R_Set (FPF2700 current limit)\nFPF2700 eq. 1: R_SET [kΩ] = 277.5 / I_LIM [A]. 549 kΩ gives I_LIM = 0.51 A typ / 0.40 A min, the\ndatasheet's characterized point at the lowest supported limit (0.4 - 2 A range).\nCaps each heater channel at ≈ 0.5 A. E96 value kept on purpose: it is the datasheet table\nvalue, and the datasheet calls for a 1 % (or better) R_SET."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 160.27 117.86 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "580e3c5f-741d-40fd-8d4d-7877f2beb6fc")
	)
	(text "HTR_A1 / HTR_B1: off-board Kapton (polyimide)\nfilm heaters, one wrapped on each 2S string.\n~25 Ohm each, must stay >= 21 Ohm\n(FPF2700 0.40 A min limit at 8.4 V).\nExcluded from board: BOM only."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 172.72 66.04 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "7c40470f-df14-458b-97ec-06e697355046")
	)
